# Generated artifacts are produced by CI and by nothing else.
#
# The catalog is the product — it belongs in this repository so raw URLs can
# serve it, but it must never appear in a working copy: it is ~25 MB across
# catalog.json / market.sql / market.db, it is regenerated from scratch on every
# run, and a stale local copy is indistinguishable from a fresh one. CI writes
# these paths with `git add -f`, which is deliberate — the ignore below applies
# to people, not to the pipeline.
/data/
/plugins.json

# Local scratch.
node_modules/
.wrangler/
*.log
